105:`first_evidence` is the **one** detail-tier field promoted into the compact return: the verbatim motivating line with `file:line` that the quote-the-line gate requires. It is **mandatory for every finding at anchor 75 or 100**. Omit it only for anchor-50 findings. Stage 5 (merge findings) recovers an omitted quote from matching artifact evidence when available and drops or demotes any 75/100 finding still missing it; Stage 5b (validation pass) uses it for the validator-skip check. Keep it to the single triggering line, not the full `evidence` array; the array stays in the artifact.
